<title>KUWAIT: KPC lifts posted product prices effective today.</title>
<headline>KPC lifts posted product prices effective today.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kuwait Petroleum Corporation on Thursday said it raised its posted product prices effective September 5.</p>
<p>Jet climbed by 4 cents to 75 cents a gallon and kerosene increased by the same amount to 74 cents.</p>
<p>Gasoil increased by 5 cents to 66 cents a gallon.</p>
<p>Marine diesel climbed by $2.00 per barrel to $25.00 and Medium fuel oil was raised by $1.50 to $17.50.</p>
<p>Heavy fuel oil climbed by $1.50 to $17 per barrel.</p>
</text>
